    "protoNote": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 520,
      "size": 20,
      "text": "Everything works. Journal: pick any day (calendar, week strip, arrows), open a trade, edit your entry, receipts, Make it a rule, Share (uses that day). Stats: 7D/30D/90D/All, chain filter, tap a calendar day to open it. Settings: pay (checkout), add/remove wallets, rules, memory, linked apps, export, delete account. M8: type or record a voice note. Hover for tooltips. Esc closes, M opens M8.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 8400,
      "y": 944
    },
